<title>UK: Council of Europe adds 100 mln Ffr to bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe adds 100 mln Ffr to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, has been increased to 1.0 billion French francs from 900 million French francs, joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Compagnie Parisienne de Reescompte said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     4.73	MATURITY  **19.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+23 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**CALLABLE 19.MAR.02</p>
<p> NOTES	COUPON STEPS UP TO 7.0 PCT IF BOND NOT CALLED</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 1717 542 7658</p>
